<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Rahman announces board changes.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Rahman announces board changes.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rahman Hydraulic Tin Bhd on Friday announced changes to its board with the resignation of executive director and board member Azlan Mohammed.</p>
<p>The commodities and property firm concern also said that Ooi Kwee Yang and Teoh Guan Hock have been appointed as board members.</p>
<p>Rahman requested the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange to extend the suspension of its stock &quot;pending further announcement&quot;.</p>
<p>The stock was suspended from April 29, being last traded at 5.05 ringgit.</p>
</text>
